</head><body><header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="/junior-nisa/">こどもNISA設計室</a><nav aria-label="メイン"><a href="/junior-nisa/system/">制度</a><a href="/junior-nisa/gift-tax/">贈与税</a><a href="/junior-nisa/withdrawal/">引き出し</a><a href="/junior-nisa/calculator/">試算</a><a href="/junior-nisa/providers/">金融機関</a><a href="/junior-nisa/updates/">更新</a><a href="/junior-nisa/sources/">一次資料</a></nav></header>
